WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:38.350
The reason no one knew
a colony was falling...

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:41.060
was because the Earth
Federation higher-ups...

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:43.570
were too busy running away.

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:48.030
The people of Dublin didn't
have time to escape.

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:52.760
Karaba sent out the Audhumla.
But how many could it save?

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:56.550
The colony fell,
and even Kamille witnessed it.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:03.460
PLE-TWO UNDER GRAVITY

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:27.580
Elle! Iino!

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:29.660
What?!

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:33.920
What good luck to run into you
again amid this chaos!

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:37.750
Let's do it!

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.010
We're too late!
Descend quickly!

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.390
I am, but...!

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.060
Scary!

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:02.270
- Check for damage!
- A-Aye, sir!

00:03:02.270 --> 00:03:04.270
Damage reported in all blocks!

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:07.320
Damn you, Haman! Do you kill people
to satisfy yourself?

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.450
The view's clearing, sir.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.840
Now that the colony
drop was a success,

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.970
I imagine Mashymre Cello is
feeling very proud of himself.

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:40.860
And here sits Glemy Toto,
now inferior even to Rakan...!

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.730
However, if I use this chance
to sink the Argama...

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:47.320
and destroy the Double Zeta,
I may yet redeem myself!

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.670
The colony's still standing?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.420
What is this? Peoples' voices?

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.680
Wailing...
Voices of grief...!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:20.540
How could anyone do
something this cruel?!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.060
So...!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:27.110
If there's any reason to fight,
it's that anger you're feeling!

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:30.030
That voice...!

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.710
Today's a good day!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.380
You...!

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:48.510
All those innocent people are dead!
Why would you do this to them?!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:50.500
What...?! What's this
fighting spirit?!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:53.800
Eat this!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:20.130
The goddess of fate will
inevitably smile upon me.

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:23.920
Awaken, Ple-Two!
Awaken!

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.000
Ple, what's wrong?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.120
A shiver.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:32.050
Your fever still hasn't gone down.
Let's get you a fresh towel.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.220
No! What l felt
just now was...

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:38.010
Stop. This is the most
crucial time for you.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:39.550
Sick people have to rest.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.760
- You have to rest.
- Have to! Have to!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:46.070
But...
Something foul... is coming...

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.780
Something foul is coming!

00:05:58.550 --> 00:06:01.160
Something foul is coming?
Kamille...

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.950
No! It was Ple?!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.050
I'll make you one more piece
of wreckage littering the land!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:16.300
This is no ordinary mobile suit!

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.640
Outta the way!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.010
This power...!

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:24.810
I can't forgive people like you!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.310
He ran!

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.450
I need to find everyone and
rendezvous with the Argama!

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:39.790
Ple-Two! Ple-Two!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:48.330
I feel gravity.
This isn't space.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:50.790
Correct. This is Earth.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.060
How long have I slept?

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:56.400
I doubt you've sorted everything
out in the meantime.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.550
If I had sorted
everything out,

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:01.180
there'd have been
no need for you, Ple-Two.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:05.930
However, the situation isn't bad.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:08.270
You could even say
we have the advantage.

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:11.650
Then why did you awaken me?

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:14.270
In battle, there are
things called opportunities.

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.980
Even when the situation
is in your allies' favor,

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:20.110
missing an opportunity
can turn it all around.

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:22.570
Spare me the
preamble, Glemy!

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:23.950
Ple-Two!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:26.580
If you want to distinguish
yourself in battle, just say so.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.370
I'll help you.

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:30.790
We just have to destroy
the Argama, right?

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.880
Just the thing to get
my body back in shape.

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:43.930
Enough waiting!
Launch the Argama!

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:45.350
B-But, sir...!

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.560
We can't contact the Audhumla!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.600
The Gundam Team's missing!

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.090
And there must still be
some survivors in Dublin!

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:55.150
- Argama, set course for Dublin!
- Y-Yes, sir!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.910
Ple? Ple, where are you?!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.680
I have to go...!

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.630
- There she is!
- She's here!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:16.330
Sh-Shinta! Take me to
the mobile suit deck!

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.920
You need to rest, Ple.

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:19.420
Need to rest!

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:21.570
The Argama's in danger!

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.730
The Argama is?

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:28.440
If I can get into
the Qubeley, I can still...!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.280
It's a little heavy, but it feels
like the one I used before.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.200
Ple-Two.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.450
What?

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.240
The Sandra will continue on...

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:52.540
to Kilimanjaro to
rendezvous with Lady Haman.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:53.330
Understood.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.680
Destroying the Argama will be
my gift to Lady Haman.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.380
Go to it, Ple-Two.

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.810
Iino, you okay?

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:10.940
I'm not hurt, but this Core
Fighter is done flying.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:13.180
Same here!

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:16.990
It's amazing we came through
that shockwave alive!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.520
I wonder if Judau and
the Argama are okay.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.230
Let's leave the
Core Fighters here!

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:27.330
Okay, I'll land the Dodai!
Elle! Iino! This way!

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:32.260
Hurry! It's dangerous
to stay here any longer!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:35.000
That's...the Audhumla!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.920
There should be a
ton of refugees in there!

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.420
Let's go, Roux!

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:42.880
Roger!

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.680
Why is the Argama in danger?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.550
Something's out there,
headed this way.

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.640
And you're saying it's
going to destroy the Argama?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.360
It's an emergency firing.
We'll only get half the usual output.

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:07.040
- That's fine!
- Putting target on main screen!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.660
Where's the target?

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:10.000
Can you see it, Ple?

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:14.620
To the right!
More to the right!

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.250
Shift firing path to the right.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:16.870
Sir!

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:19.540
About 13 degrees... hold it!

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:20.380
Hold!

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.210
Up more! Four degrees!

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.130
Up, four degrees.

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:24.430
Sir!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.420
There!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:28.680
Hold it!

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:30.050
I don't see a target.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.850
It doesn't matter!
Lock sight!

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:32.550
Sir!

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:36.200
Almost... it's coming...
It's here! Now!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.360
High mega cannon, fire!

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.570
Did we get it?

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:51.080
I don't know. Monitor at
maximum magnification!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.060
We penetrated the colony!

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:58.250
- That's...!
- Model, confirmed! Psyco Gundam Mk. II!

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.540
A Psyco Gundam...
Ple--

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:03.710
Ple! Hey!

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:09.930
How dare you, Argama!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.940
- Psyco Gundam, incoming!
- Where are our anti-air guns?!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.320
Port-side catapult, hit!

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:28.110
Evade, full power!
High mega cannon!

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.490
It'll need time to
recharge its energy!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:34.790
What? Looks like I hit some wreckage,
but what about the Argama?

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:37.450
Yes?

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.450
The mobile suit deck's
lower hatch is open!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.830
Did you open it?!

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.090
No!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.510
The Qubeley!

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:48.430
We're disassembling that!
Who's in there?!

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:51.220
You want the Argama
to be destroyed?!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.270
With the Qubeley, I can still...!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.820
Finally, here comes a mobile suit
from the Argama.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.070
What?!

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.080
Audhumla!

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:19.830
Audhumla, come in!
No good! They're not answering!

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:22.540
The Audhumla's slowly losing altitude.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:24.500
Maybe something happened
on the Audhumla's bridge.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.380
That's why they're not
responding to our hails.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:28.210
The refugees are
still on board, right?

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.130
Beecha, make contact
with the bridge!

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:31.340
Huh?!

00:12:31.340 --> 00:12:34.340
Roux, you hear that?
We're grabbing on to the Audhumla!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:36.810
It's our only option.
Get going!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.350
Try to match speeds more!
Velocity zero!

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:44.530
I know!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.690
Stay sharp, or that wind
pressure will blow us off!

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:52.900
I'll hold us down with the Zeta!
Somebody, get to the bridge!

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:55.960
Roger! But from where?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.410
Beecha, there!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:00.250
- Oh!
- The lookout dome?

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:05.460
It was hit on the right.
If I can get around it...

00:13:06.020 --> 00:13:07.220
This feeling...

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.050
They're reading me!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:19.900
What is this feeling?
This roughness...!

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.820
I have to try!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.030
What are you?!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.790
It's doing the same?!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.130
I'll wipe away
this sickening thing!

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.810
No, you don't!

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:03.400
It dodged the beams returning from my
reflector bits?! What are you?!

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.940
It got all of them?!
Then...!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:10.570
Hah! Clever!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:20.450
How do you know
what I'm about to do?!

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:23.080
That's my line!

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:26.870
Why are you facing the Psyco
Gundam in a mobile suit like that?!

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.460
You disturb me!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:31.760
If you hate me so much,
then go back to space!

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:37.310
This will finish you!

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.310
I hit it!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.280
J-Judau...

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.700
Why are you out here?!
You'll die! Go back!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:15:00.540
I... I'll be okay. Just be careful!
That pilot is exactly like me!

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.750
You mean they're a Newtype?

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:07.660
So, that's the Double Zeta?

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:10.920
Hmph! How intriguing...
Double Zeta!

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.930
Wh-What's...?

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.200
It... it's a Gundam!

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:31.140
The Psyco Gundam Mk. II!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:32.030
Psyco...?

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:39.610
What's this feeling?
Ple, get back to the Argama!

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:40.360
But...!

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:42.120
This is my enemy!

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:48.540
Iino, just a bit more...!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.410
- All right!
- You did it, Iino!

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:56.920
This way!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.850
- Iino!
- Right!

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:06.640
The hatch-open switch
should be... this one!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.900
Forget it. They're dead!

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.310
The hatch is open!

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.280
We're going in!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.320
The mobile suits came back!

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.030
Just one?

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:25.210
Are there any Karaba
members in here?

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.330
They all went out
in mobile suits!

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:29.240
Are you from the Federation?

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:31.330
Can't you see who we are?!

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:34.550
So, the only Karaba
members were on the bridge?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.430
It looks like it.

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:45.620
You're no better than a baby
compared to the Psyco Gundam!

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.940
It's not working!
What now, Judau?

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.850
I've had enough of
playing tag with you.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.530
Fall, Double Zeta!

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.460
Not good.
My engine's burning up!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:18.880
Uh-oh! Here it comes!

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:23.210
Damn!

00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:25.980
Hmpf! At your limit?

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:35.530
I have you now, Double Zeta!
Accept your fate!

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:37.240
Not yet!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.040
We're now in contact
with the Audhumla!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:55.660
What?!

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.210
This is the Audhumla!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:58.870
The refugees are unharmed!

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.840
We're heading south
toward the sea!

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:04.560
Right! Set course to assist the
Audhumla! Full speed ahead!

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:13.270
Where's the Psyco Gundam?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.530
Double Zeta!
I'm surprised you're intact!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.530
I'm out of beam energy!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.580
Judau!

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.080
Ple!

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:42.210
Judau, I understand!
The Psyco Gundam's pilot...!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.380
Huh? "Understand"?

00:18:44.380 --> 00:18:47.710
You again?!
The one who disturbs me so!

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.970
Of course l disturb you.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:53.020
Wh-What do you mean?
What are you saying?!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.070
Ple, no!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:03.110
It's natural. It's just human to be
disturbed at the sight of yourself.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:06.610
But no matter how it disturbs you,
no matter how you might hate it,

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:10.900
you can't kill yourself!
You can't stop being you!

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:13.820
What are you talking about?

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:17.410
I'm you, and you're me!

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:21.500
You're a person with only
my most violent traits!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.340
I am... Elpeo Ple!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:28.640
I'm Ple-Two...
I AM PLE-TWO!

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:33.940
Myself... DIE!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:54.290
I-It's still alive?

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.210
The Psyco Gundam...

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:11.640
Now, you die too!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.190
What?!

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:23.570
You... you... YOU...!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:34.630
P-Ple was... inside the
Double Zeta's mind?

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:36.620
You won't escape!

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:00.010
That was Ple...

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:03.320
Ple was killed by... Ple...!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:48.900
This battle required far
too many sacrifices.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:51.400
But we can at least
take some comfort...

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:54.820
in having been able to
save even a few Dubliners.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:59.040
And so, let us offer a silent prayer
to our fallen comrades.

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:02.750
All hands! Honors, hut!

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:13.970
Black rain...

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:48.470 --> 00:23:50.960
Haman has returned to space.

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:54.840
And we, too, leave for space
from a northern Karaba base.

00:23:54.840 --> 00:23:57.090
This is so we can rendezvous
with our new warship...

00:23:57.090 --> 00:23:59.590
to infiltrate Side 3,
where Haman is now.

00:23:59.590 --> 00:24:03.400
But a new female warrior
is waiting for us there!

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:08.680
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Nahel Argama."

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:08.680
Next Time

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:08.680
NAHEL ARGAMA

00:24:09.700 --> 00:24:11.190
And Mashymre, too?!
